<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan central bank neutral in banking system.</title>
<headline>Taiwan central bank neutral in banking system.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank injected no funds into the banking system through open market operations on Thursday as no financial institutions bid for the funds, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>The bank said earlier on Thursday it would execute within-five-day open market operations, through bills finance companies, on qualified securities instruments offered by interested financial institutions.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
